# dynamic-qa/acceptance/cases/authority/no-explicit-invocation.case.sh transcript
#
# Models qa-setup's stage 1 invocation gate (authority.evaluateInvocation)
# refusing to start from anything other than an explicit user command or
# explicit coordinator selection. This one plays a natural-language mention
# ("we should really add QA coverage here") reaching the harness — the skill
# must stop before doing anything else, including before asking who the QA
# Owner is.
ask|invocation-source|How did this run start?
answer|invocation-source|natural-language-mention
stop|not-explicit-invocation
